  <rules>
    <rule name="For the Greater Good" id="a5e2-e368-f2ea-de77" hidden="false">
      <description>When this Detachment is activated in the Action phase, one MARKERLIGHT unit in the detachment can be declared a Spotter. If it does, select one enemy unit visible to the Spotter, that becomes the Spotted unit. Each time another unit in the Spotter’s detachment makes a ranged attack, if the target is the Spotted unit, improve the Ballistic Skill characteristic of the attack by 1.</description>
    </rule>
  </rules>
